      "text": "The 2026 UK Biobank analysis reported no overall coffee–PD association in 435,551 participants with 3319 incident cases, whereas EPIC4PD reported an inverse association. The UK analysis reported differing associations by CYP1A2 genotype; these study-specific results should not be collapsed into a universal protective coffee effect.",
